# Local dev secrets (SEC-5): never committed. .env.local holds the Vite dev token.
.env
.env.local
# The local database file. DB2: the engine is node:sqlite and its data is a working artefact, not source.
# Ignored rather than placed outside the tree because it holds no secret; SEC-5 governs credentials, and the
# signing key still resolves from the out-of-tree store or the derived environment variable and never from here.
.data/
